<%# The People lead panel (D-people-dashboard, docs/PEOPLE.md §3): identity capture while
    the circle is empty, then the social dashboard. The events card renders inside Coming up and the
    roster lives in the Address Book — the panel hides both generic
    versions via hidden_browse. %>
<% if panel.circle_size.zero? %>
  <%= render "sections/people_capture", address_book_size: panel.address_book_size %>
<% end %>

<%= render "sections/give_time", openings: panel.openings %>

<%= render "sections/people_hub",
      cards: panel.circle_cards, reach_out: panel.reach_out,
      birthdays: panel.upcoming_birthdays, events: @events, address_book_size: panel.address_book_size %>
